How to Delete Static Pods

	You cannot delete static pods using kubectl.

Wrong:

	kubectl delete pod nginx-static

Correct:

	Delete the YAML file from the node.

	rm /etc/kubernetes/manifests/nginx.yaml

Kubelet detects removal and stops the pod.

=======================================================================================================


Real World Use of Static Pods

	Static pods are used for Kubernetes control plane components.

Example:

	kube-apiserver
	kube-scheduler
	kube-controller-manager
	etcd

Example file:

	/etc/kubernetes/manifests/kube-apiserver.yaml


